{"id":"jama_s","lemma":"jamás","pos":"adv","rank":485,"glosses":["never","ever"],"ipa":"/xaˈmas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-jam%C3%A1s.wav","examples":[{"text":"Jamás había oído tal cosa.","en":"I've never heard of such a thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527437","words":[null,{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"hearing"},{"g":"such"},{"g":"thing"}]},{"text":"Jamás he visto algo así.","en":"I've never seen anything like this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798383","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"kind of"]]},{"text":"Jamás me haría hacerlo, ¿a que no?","en":"You'd never make me do that, would you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506576","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"I bet"]]},{"text":"Jamás te voy a ayudar.","en":"I'll never help you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448789","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Jamás estuve enojado contigo.","en":"I was never mad at you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460905","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"angry, mad"},{"g":"with you"}]}]}